        "y1": 615.12,
        "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Grantor hereby grants to Grantee a perpetual, non-exclusive easement for the installation, operation, maintenance, repair, and",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 583.92,
        "x1": 562.74,
        "y1": 595.92,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "replacement of utility lines and related facilities.",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 570.42,
        "x1": 254.78,
        "y1": 582.42,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "The easement is for electric, telecommunications, and related utilities (the \u201cUtilities\u201d).",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 546.12,
        "x1": 406.41999999999996,
        "y1": 558.12,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
