        "y0": 521.82,
        "x1": 149.337,
        "y1": 535.0200000000001,
        "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "The easement area is a strip of land twenty feet (20') in width running along the north boundary of the Property (the",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 503.82000000000005,
        "x1": 523.75,
        "y1": 515.82,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "\u201cEasement Area\u201d).",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 490.32000000000005,
        "x1": 136.72,
        "y1": 502.32000000000005,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "No buildings, structures, or permanent improvements shall be constructed within the Easement Area without the prior written",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 466.02000000000004,
        "x1": 563.36,
        "y1": 478.02000000000004,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "consent of Grantee.",
