        "y0": 452.52000000000004,
        "x1": 139.23,
        "y1": 464.52000000000004,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "RIGHTS AND RESTRICTIONS",
        "x0": 54.0,
        "y0": 428.22,
        "x1": 207.395,
        "y1": 441.42,
        "font": "Helvetica-Bold",
        "size": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "Grantee may enter the Easement Area at reasonable times for utility purposes. Grantor shall not interfere with the Utilities.",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 410.22,
        "x1": 552.22,
        "y1": 422.22,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Grantee may require removal of obstructions within the Easement Area that materially interfere with the Utilities, subject to",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 385.92,
        "x1": 557.23,
        "y1": 397.92,
        "font": "Times-Roman",
        "size": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "reasonable notice.",
        "x0": 61.199999999999996,
        "y0": 372.42,
        "x1": 133.4,
        "y1": 384.42,
